  "text": "proprium.dominica-post-ascensionem-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Sunday after Ascension” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Almighty and everlasting God, make us ever bear a devoted will toward Thee and serve Thy majesty with a sincere heart. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
